<title>NORWAY: Norske SKOG plans French investment.</title>
<headline>Norske SKOG plans French investment.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian forestry group Norske Skogindustrier ASA plans to invest 2.8 billion crowns in expanding production at its newsprint plant in Golbey, France, a statement to the Oslo Bourse said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
